  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">U.S. Contribution to Gaza Humanitarian Relief</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The contribution from the U.S. Department of State to the Gaza Humanitarian Foundation (GHF) supports life-saving food assistance. This funding is part of the United States broader commitment to addressing urgent needs in conflict-affected regions. The award aims to expand access to urgently needed, life-saving food assistance for the most vulnerable populations in Gaza.</narrative>
  </description>
